bout a very  interesting interview  with former British Prime Minister David  Cameron who is calling the brexit  referendum that led to everything we  have seen since January 23 2016 the day  of that vote his greatest regret and it  still is not clear in fact it is sort of  more and more clear it's it's unclear  that brexit is going to happen you could  also argue it is more clear that it is  not going to happen but we'll have that  conversation on the bonus show all of  those stories and more including the  distraction of producer Pat as the  voicemail caller said on today's bonus  show two ways to get access become a  member at join pakman.com become a  patron at patreon.com slash david pakman  show and remember you can call the  voicemail number 24 hours a day and many  of you do the number of voicemails we  get between like 2:00 and 5:00 a.m.  Eastern Time is is high it's very very  high two one nine two david p is the  number and i hope you will join me this  evening for a live stream on twitch at  twitch.tv slash david pakman follow me  subscribe there with twitch prime and i  hope you'll join me this evening  the david pakman show at david  pakman.com  [Music]
 

